    "summary": "fix(trackers): stop passing ticket: {} to ado_get_work_item_comments (#1174)",
    "description": "## Summary\n- Fix `ClassCastException: class org.json.JSONObject cannot be cast to class com.github.istin.dmtools.common.model.ITicket` when calling `adoGetComments(key)` in `js/common/trackers.js`.\n- In GraalJS (`JobJavaScriptBridge`), passing `{ ticket: {} }` converts the JS object `{}` into an `org.json.JSONObject`. When `MCPToolExecutor.executeAdoGetWorkItemComments` calls `convertParameter(ticketValue, \"com.github.istin.dmtools.common.model.ITicket\", \"ticket\")`, `ITicket` is an interface with no `JSONObject` constructor, so `convertParameter` returns the raw `JSONObject` unchecked and triggers a `ClassCastException` at the call site.\n- Since `epam/dm.ai#751` already marks `ticket` as `@MCPParam(required = false)` on `ado_get_work_item_comments`, omitting `ticket` (`{ id: String(key) }`) passes `null` cleanly without throwing `ClassCastException`.\n\nFixes #1174"
  }
}

